{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56267","headline":"登戎州江楼闲望 · 幸夤逊","name":"登戎州江楼闲望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满目江山四望幽，白云高卷嶂烟收。\n日廻禽影穿疎木，风递猿声入小楼。\n远岫似屏横碧落，断帆如叶截中流。\n[□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□]。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一六三《叙州》。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七六一收三四两句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"幸夤逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}